---
title: Par and critical
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant EmailSvc
    participant SmsSvc
    participant DB
    par send email
        Client->>EmailSvc: Notify
    and send sms
        Client->>SmsSvc: Notify
    end
    critical acquire lock
        Client->>DB: Write
    option lock unavailable
        DB-->>Client: Retry later
    end
